external to that SpdxDocument.&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:definition</td><td align='left'>&quot;A map of Element identifiers that are used within an SpdxDocument but defined
external to that SpdxDocument.&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:note</td><td align='left'>&quot;An external map is a map of Element identifiers that are used within an
SpdxDocument but defined external to that SpdxDocument.
The external map provides details about the externally-defined Element
such as its provenance, where to retrieve it, and how to verify its integrity.&quot;@en</td></tr></table> > ] 
